Members States shall take the necessary measures to make effective investigation tools, such as those used in the fight against organized crime or other serious forms of crime, available to the persons, units or services responsible for investigations or prosecutions concerning offenses covered by Article 3, paragraphs 1 and 5, and Article 4.

Article 12:
Replacement of certain provisions of Framework Decision 2001/500/JHA:
Point b) of Article 1 and Article 2 of Framework Decision 2001/500/JHA are replaced for the Member States bound by this Directive, without prejudice to their obligations regarding the transposition of the Framework Decision into national law.

For the Member States bound by this Directive, references to the provisions of Framework Decision 2001/500/JHA mentioned in the first paragraph are understood as references to this Directive.

